    "results": [
      {
        "description": "Validation results for BSI TR-03183-2, derived only from the supplied SBOM.",
        "findings": [
          {
            "description": "Overall verdict for BSI TR-03183-2: 3 error(s), 5 warning(s), 0 informational finding(s).",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "bsi-compliance",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "BSI TR-03183-2 compliance roll-up",
            "uuid": "182bf597-1b10-542e-a542-e76c0f07545f"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.1\\] Creator of the SBOM missing (email address, or URL if no email is available); generation tools (metadata.tools) do not satisfy the field — provide a Person/Organization creator (e.g. CycloneDX metadata.authors or metadata.manufacturer)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:000354355e33ac4a"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-1|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "a4b3a9ab-129a-5910-96e6-c75949057c79"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Identify the SBOM creator with an email address, or a URL (e.g. the creator's home page) if no email is available; generation tools do not count as the creator. SPDX 3.0: set creationInfo.createdBy to a Person or Organization element that has a name; createdUsing tools do not count.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-5-1",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-1",
            "uuid": "2840c3f2-ab73-5cde-85b6-7bb3794243ca"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.2\\] 1/3 component(s) missing distribution licence(s): lib-utils",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:82644af310164731"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-LICENSE|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "66ec0077-14a8-5a22-930b-83b420a55a9d"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Declare the distribution licence(s) of every component, named by SPDX licence identifier or expression (§6.1). SPDX 3.0: add a hasDeclaredLicense (or hasConcludedLicense) Relationship from the package to a simplelicensing\\_LicenseExpression element.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-license",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-LICENSE",
            "uuid": "a206b309-7ffc-552a-b571-81135c160fcc"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.2\\] 2/3 component(s) missing a component creator (supplier/author with email, or URL if no email)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:c7b9741417339d70"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-CREATOR|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "df36d7c6-7838-50c7-87c8-9fd801c8bff3"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Record the component creator: the email address (or URL if no email) of the entity that created or maintains the component. SPDX 3.0: set suppliedBy on the package to the spdxId of an Organization or Person element.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-creator",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-CREATOR",
            "uuid": "af78c830-bc78-5447-ae14-11725deb1047"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.2\\] 2/3 component(s) carry hashes but none is a valid SHA-512 digest (the TR names the algorithm; SHA-256 or others alone do not satisfy the required field): my-app, lib-core (SHA-256 digest is not 64 hex characters; SHA-512 digest is not 128 hex characters)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:f40d65709c70d36b"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-4|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "bdada49a-5e4f-5c9c-973f-9945503cc495"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Provide the hash of the deployed/deployable component as SHA-512 — §5.2.2 names the algorithm, so SHA-256 or other algorithms alone do not satisfy the required field (additional hashes may coexist). SPDX 3.0: add a verifiedUsing\\[\\] Hash entry with algorithm sha512.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-5-4",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-4",
            "uuid": "afb30e37-189b-5e76-b3ce-477bb4239143"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.2\\] 1/3 component(s) have no hash of the deployable form; required as SHA-512 unless the information is unavailable due to the way the component is assembled (§3.2.1)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:39fcb85483501b9b"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-4-MISSING|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "42f9753c-38c2-563d-95e5-a72afb2a0148"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Add a SHA-512 hash of the deployable component. §3.2.1 permits omission only when the information cannot exist due to the way the component is assembled (e.g. logical components). SPDX 3.0: add a verifiedUsing\\[\\] Hash entry with algorithm sha512.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-5-4-missing",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-4-MISSING",
            "uuid": "c4da7663-43a0-562b-aaed-d546c8941983"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.2\\] Completeness of the dependency enumeration is not clearly indicated (CycloneDX compositions.aggregate / SPDX 3 relationship completeness)",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:c4680981eb8cf7ab"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-5-COMPLETENESS|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "b7137034-a887-5bf7-b11d-cf2ba0358e23"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Clearly indicate the completeness of the dependency enumeration (complete or incomplete). SPDX 3.0: set completeness (complete or incomplete) on the dependsOn Relationship elements.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-5-5-completeness",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-5-COMPLETENESS",
            "uuid": "2800a57f-4763-52c1-b1d3-ff889c7bef34"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §5.2.4\\] 1/3 component(s) missing a unique identifier (purl/CPE/SWHID/SWID) — an additional-tier field that MUST be provided when one exists: lib-utils",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:9acdf22246e78381"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-2-4|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "bac61b88-2645-5c47-aa94-e522c7203fd1"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Add unique identifiers (purl, CPE) to components. §5.2.4 is the additional tier: the field MUST be provided when an identifier exists for the component. SPDX 3.0: set software\\_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier\\[\\] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-5-2-4",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-5-2-4",
            "uuid": "d361cd18-60b1-5904-98fe-65409f210382"
          },
          {
            "description": "\\[BSI TR-03183-2 §3.1\\] SBOM carries vulnerability information on 1/4 component(s); a document containing both SBOM and vulnerability information does not conform — publish advisories separately (e.g. CSAF). Ignore if the data was attached by enrichment rather than present in the source document.",
            "links": [
              {
                "href": "https://bsi.bund.de/dok/TR-03183-en",
                "rel": "help"
              }
            ],
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "finding-id",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "sbomtools:v1:a4b11bafe5f569cf"
              },
              {
                "name": "finding-key",
                "ns": "https://sbom.tools/ns/oscal",
                "value": "bsi|SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-3-1|document"
              }
            ],
            "related-observations": [
              {
                "observation-uuid": "30276322-0a20-5876-b522-04dcfdc94784"
              }
            ],
            "remarks": "Remove vulnerability information from the SBOM and publish it separately (e.g. as CSAF advisories); a document containing both SBOM and vulnerability information does not conform to TR-03183-2. SPDX 3.0: remove the security\\_Vulnerability elements and their affects and assessment Relationships.",
            "target": {
              "status": {
                "state": "not-satisfied"
              },
              "target-id": "sbom-bsi-tr-03183-2-3-1",
              "type": "objective-id"
            },
            "title": "SBOM-BSI-TR-03183-2-3-1",
            "uuid": "cb5eb385-b279-5512-ae33-f86b1709716e"
          }
        ],
